Subject: [REVIEW 08/09] Qualcomm SoC USB4 descriptions

Add the shared Glymur/Hamoa PHY/router description changes needed by the tested topology. Review clock, reset, interconnect and endpoint contracts against the drivers.

Dependencies: Patches 01-07 provide the referenced interfaces. Shared SoC placement does not establish testing on other boards.

Source attribution: Konrad Dybcio Hamoa PHY description changes in provenance/usb4/00-usb4phy-v5-konrad-dybcio.mbox, plus local Glymur integration in provenance/usb4/04-glymur-usb4-bindings-board.diff and provenance/derivation.json.

This is a review grouping of preserved source, not a new authorship claim or
an independently build-validated upstream commit. Original attribution remains
in the referenced provenance files. No new Signed-off-by trailers are added.

---
